# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 3: Verify zero QPU overhead with LTM AI-QEM {#example-3-verify-zero-qpu-overhead-with-ltm-ai-qem}"
msgstr "Halimbawa 3: Beripikahin ang zero QPU overhead gamit ang LTM AI-QEM {#example-3-verify-zero-qpu-overhead-with-ltm-ai-qem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example shows that the LTM AI-QEM function doesn't use any extra QPU time. That is, LTM AI-QEM uses no more QPU time than the Estimator primitive. The example again uses the mirror circuit, this time with two types of PUBs. In the first type, called the commuting type, all of the Pauli observables commute with each other. In the second type, called the non-commuting type, none of the Pauli observables commute with each other.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng halimbawang ito na hindi gumagamit ang LTM AI-QEM function ng anumang dagdag na QPU time. Ibig sabihin, hindi lumalampas ang LTM AI-QEM sa QPU time ng Estimator primitive. Muling ginagamit ng halimbawa ang mirror circuit, ngayon ay may dalawang uri ng PUB. Sa unang uri, na tinatawag na commuting type, nagko-commute ang lahat ng Pauli observable sa isa't isa. Sa pangalawang uri, na tinatawag na non-commuting type, wala sa mga Pauli observable ang nagko-commute sa isa't isa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For each type, the observables are defined in two ways: as a list of Pauli operators (`list_of_commuting` and `list_of_non_commuting`), and as a single `SparsePauliOp` object that represents the sum of all the Pauli operators in the list (`sum_of_commuting` and `sum_of_non_commuting`).\n"
msgstr "Para sa bawat uri, tinutukoy ang mga observable sa dalawang paraan: bilang listahan ng mga Pauli operator (`list_of_commuting` at `list_of_non_commuting`), at bilang iisang `SparsePauliOp` object na kumakatawan sa kabuuan ng lahat ng Pauli operator sa listahan (`sum_of_commuting` at `sum_of_non_commuting`).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
